# The temperature sensor freezes on a healthy value one second in.
# Every frozen reading is inside the normal range, so the threshold detector alone reports nothing
# (a healthy run has 0 criticals). Only the sliding window notices, and only once it is full of
# identical readings: the first critical is cycle 19, so cycles 19..39 give 21 criticals.
cycles 40
period_ms 100

at 1000 fault Stuck

expect critical == 21
expect invalid == 0
